{"version":1,"content":"<p>方力申將在本月21日進行「港澳慈善游2026」，今日（18日）趁破浪前夕與15位基層學童由西環出發，乘坐電車巡遊，並獲不少市民打氣兼送上祝福。</p><p>方力申當日將會完成由大嶼山到澳門黑沙海灘的35公里渡海泳，上岸後隨即趕往為「《浪接‧浪》港澳群星慈</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:04:00.050502+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:22:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:14.251269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:14.251269+00:00","content_hash":"0fb5b0f2dc9caf5bf60ee782368600ddc9562d0a4e0ba8d867cecfb1a830430a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}